      "content": "KINGS LANGLEY          \tHIGH STREET TL 0702  \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                       13/133                                  \tBarn at rear of -                                      \t\tNos. 15/17 GV                                      \tII Barn, now a workshop. Early C17, reduced to single bay by building of No. 13 at N in C17. Timber frame, brick nogged with steep old red tile roof. Picturesque, single-storey square building facing W at rear of yard. Stepped jowled posts, straight braces to tie-beams, clasped-purlin roof with straight wind braces. Listing NGR: TL0719502792"
    }
